    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.02",
    "summary": "Terrain features fall into three categories: Exposed, Light and Dense. A feature's category affects how models move and what they can see. A mission's deployment map may specify the categories in each terrain area. One area can contain features of different categories.",
